# vim -u NONE -N FILE: insert 30 lines with tabs and UTF-8, move, :set number, scroll, :q!
wait 1500
send i
send line 01\tplain ASCII text with a tab\r
send line 02\t\tdouble tab\r
send line 03 UTF-8: café naïve résumé Ünïcödé\r
send line 04 Greek: αβγδε ΑΒΓΔΕ\r
send line 05 Cyrillic: Привет мир\r
send line 06 CJK wide: 日本語テキスト 中文\r
send line 07 Hangul: 한국어\r
send line 08 emoji: 😀 🚀 ✨\r
send line 09 box: ┌──┬──┐ │a │b │ └──┴──┘\r
send line 10\tcol1\tcol2\tcol3\r
send line 11 the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog\r
send line 12 THE QUICK BROWN FOX JUMPS OVER THE LAZY DOG\r
send line 13 0123456789 !@#$%^&*()_+-=[]{};:'",.<>/?\r
send line 14 a long line that goes past the eightieth column so that vim has to wrap it onto the next screen row\r
send line 15 math: ∑ ∫ √ ≤ ≥ ≠ ∞ π\r
send line 16\tindented\r
send line 17 arrows: ← ↑ → ↓ ⇒\r
send line 18 mixed: abc日本def中ghi\r
send line 19 accents: àáâãäå èéêë\r
send line 20 currency: € £ ¥ ₹ ₩\r
send line 21\ttrailing tab\t\r
send line 22 quotes: “double” ‘single’ «guillemets»\r
send line 23 Thai: สวัสดี\r
send line 24 Hebrew: שלום\r
send line 25 dingbats: ✓ ✗ ★ ☆ ♠ ♥\r
send line 26 fullwidth: ＡＢＣ１２３\r
send line 27\t\t\tthree tabs\r
send line 28 keyboard: ⌘ ⌥ ⇧ ⌃\r
send line 29 last but one\r
send line 30 the end\x1b
wait 500
send gg
wait 200
send :set number\r
wait 300
send 5j$
wait 200
send 3w
wait 200
send G
wait 300
send \x15
wait 300
send \x04
wait 300
send \x05\x05\x05
wait 300
send \x19\x19
wait 300
send 14G
wait 300
send :q!\r
end
